### MS Users API - Testes
### Use a extensão REST Client do VS Code ou similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = seu_access_token_aqui
@refreshToken = seu_refresh_token_aqui

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Registrar Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456"
}

### 4. Verificar Email (use o token recebido no registro)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token_de_verificacao_aqui"
}

### 5. Login após verificação
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456"
}

### 6. Obter Perfil (requer autenticação)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Solicitar Reset de Senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com"
}

### 9. Resetar Senha (use o token recebido por email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "token": "token_de_reset_aqui",
  "newPassword": "novaSenha123456"
}

### 10. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. Logout de Todos os Dispositivos (requer autenticação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

